{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptECS","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Declare a system","anchor":"Declare-a-system"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Apply "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@system"},{"type":"text","text":" to a class and implement "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"update(context)"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"code":["@system(scheduler: \"update\", id: \"game.movement\")","class MovementSystem {","    func update(context) {","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"ada"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The scheduler defaults to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"update"},{"type":"text","text":". System identifiers must be unique within a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"script module."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Declare a query","anchor":"Declare-a-query"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Apply "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@query"},{"type":"text","text":" to a stored system property:"}]},{"code":["@query(","    Health,","    Movement,","    with: Movable,","    without: Frozen",")","var entities;"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"ada"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Positional components are fetched and available on each row. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"with"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"without"},{"type":"text","text":" only filter matching archetypes."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Aliases use lower-camel-case component names:"}]},{"code":["for (var entity in entities) {","    var position = entity.movement.position;","    entity.health.current -= 1.0;","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"ada"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"entity.id"},{"type":"text","text":" exposes the native entity identifier."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Iterator behavior","anchor":"Iterator-behavior"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Ada Script queries are native iterators. AdaECS resolves matching archetypes,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"binds component columns when entering a chunk, and advances their pointers by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"row stride. The bridge does not create an entity proxy for every result and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"does not perform a world component lookup for every field access."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A query row and its component views are borrowed. Do not retain them after the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"loop or system update returns. Structural changes must use deferred commands."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Inactive entities are skipped. Empty queries execute zero loop iterations."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Component fields","anchor":"Component-fields"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Component"},{"type":"text","text":" Swift macro generates the runtime field accessors used by Ada"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Script. Register native components before the script plugin is set up."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Supported field values include booleans, integers, finite floating-point"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"values, strings, vectors, quaternions, colors, and reflected enums. A rejected"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"write leaves the component unchanged and appends a development diagnostic."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Access planning","anchor":"Access-planning"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The current implementation conservatively declares write access for fetched"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"components. This keeps scheduling correct while compiler-level read\/write"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"inference is completed. Filter-only components do not receive write access."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The intended final behavior derives read and write sets from row field usage,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with explicit "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@access"},{"type":"text","text":" metadata as the escape hatch for dynamic code."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Multiple queries","anchor":"Multiple-queries"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"One system may declare multiple independent iterators:"}]},{"code":["@system(scheduler: \"update\")","class TargetingSystem {","    @query(Player, Transform)","    var players;","","    @query(Enemy, Target, without: Dead)","    var enemies;","","    func update(context) {","        for (var enemy in enemies) {","            for (var player in players) {","                enemy.target.entity = player.id;","                break;","            }","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"ada"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Queries are refreshed by the scheduler before each system execution."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Ada Script"}],"role":"article","title":"Ada Script ECS","roleHeading":"Article"},"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Declare annotation-driven systems and iterate native AdaECS component columns."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting"]]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptDiagnosticsAndPerformance"],"title":"ECS Integration","generated":true,"anchor":"ECS-Integration"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascriptecs"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting":{"role":"collection","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/adascripting","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting","title":"Ada Script","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Write gameplay systems in Ada Script while keeping entity filtering and access planning in AdaEngine’s native ECS."}]},"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/AdaScriptDiagnosticsAndPerformance":{"role":"article","type":"topic","kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascriptdiagnosticsandperformance","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptDiagnosticsAndPerformance","title":"Ada Script Diagnostics and Performance","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Understand annotation, setup, and runtime failures and keep ECS work on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"native chunk path."}]}}}